[13921]="70030446\n1\tCollect pelts from Wargs at the Howling Wood\tPelts can be found on the Wargs have recently moved into the worksite to the east of Floodwend. You should collect Warg-pelts from the Howling Wood.\n2\tCollect pelts from Wargs at the Howling Wood (total: 8)\tPelts can be found on the Wargs have recently moved into the worksite to the east of Floodwend. You should collect Warg-pelts from the Howling Wood.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have collected many trophies of the Wargs that prowl the Howling Wood near Floodwend. These will hang on the walls of Floodwend's homes as signs of courage and valour against the evil beasts.\n",
[13922]="70053080\n1\tCollect stone-giant medallions\tStone-giants can be found on the northern edge of the Gladdenmere. You should collect medallions from the stone-giants you defeat in the Gladdenmere.\n2\tCollect stone-giant medallions (total: 10)\tStone-giants can be found on the northern edge of the Gladdenmere. You should collect medallions from the stone-giants you defeat in the Gladdenmere.\n3\tBring the medallions to Varthmath in the Gladdenmere\tVarthmath can be found in the Gladdenmere. You should bring the medallions to Varthmath.\n",
